~⑤ 기본 Context 구성은 공통 / T는 첫 해석을 끝내고 다시 호출 / A는 실행을 멈췄다가 같은 실행을 재개 (지원 미확인)" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=22;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="82" width="2492" height="29" /></mxCell><mxCell id="footer-0" value="VIA / Stage 4 / 구조 탐색, 미채택 대안 / 구현 및 측정 결과 아님" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=18;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1396" width="2492" height="25" /></mxCell><mxCell id="panel-title0-0" value="T  실제 reviewed target" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="72" y="187" width="2468" height="35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="panel-title1-0" value="A  대안 구조" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=28;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1336" y="187" width="1204" height="35" /></mxCell><mxCell id="legend-0" value="박스: Component 또는 논리 실행체 이름 / 번호 화살표: 동작과 순서 / 검정: 공통 / 파랑: 달라지는 구조" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=21;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="48" y="1324" width="2492" height="28" /></mxCell><mxCell id="0-common-0" value="공통 ①~⑤: 두 안 모두 최초 해석 전에 같은 기본 Context를 구성한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="88" y="1169" width="2452" height="26" /></mxCell><mxCell id="0-common-1" value="기본 Context는 현재 입력, 선택과 화면 근거, 최근 응답, 관련 Task 후보 등 허용된 최소 근거다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="88" y="1198" width="2452" height="26" /></mxCell><mxCell id="1-common-0" value="공통 ①~⑤: 두 안 모두 최초 해석 전에 같은 기본 Context를 구성한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1352" y="1169" width="1188" height="26" /></mxCell><mxCell id="1-common-1" value="기본 Context는 현재 입력, 선택과 화면 근거, 최근 응답, 관련 Task 후보 등 허용된 최소 근거다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#171717;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1352" y="1198" width="1188" height="26" /></mxCell><mxCell id="0-commit-0" value="⑱ Request Controller가 현재 revision과 receipt를 확인한다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1458C0;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=0;connectable=0;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="608" y="981" width="1932" height="26" /></mxCell><mxCell id="0-commit-1" value="조건이 맞으면 Semantic Commit, 아니면 질문 또는 실패로 보낸다." style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=nowrap;overflow=visible;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontColor=#1458C0;fontSize=19;fontStyle=0;fontFamily=Arial;a